@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber 100
actor User
actor Application
User -> Application: launches
activate Application
Application -> Storage: Request 'last app-context'
activate Storage
alt success
  Storage --> Application: returns last 'app-context'
  Application -> Storage: request <i>UnitOfMeasureConfiguration</i>\n by id
  Storage --> Application: returns previously selected\n<i>UnitOfMeasureConfiguration</i>
else no context found
  autonumber 200
  Storage --> Application: No context found
  deactivate
  Application -> Search: search for <i>UnitOfMeasureConfiguration</i>\nwith conditions, e.g. default configurations
  activate Search
  Search --> Application: returns zero or more\n<i>UnitOfMeasureConfiguration</i>
  deactivate
end
Application --> User: show UI
...
autonumber 300
User -> Application: change\ndisplay units
Application --> User: update\npresentation
User -> Application: set as new default
...
autonumber 400
User -> Application: close
Application -> Storage: update <i>UnitOfMeasureConfiguration</i>\nwith updated personalised\ndisplay unit
activate Storage
Application -> Storage: update 'last app-context'
destroy Application
deactivate
deactivate
@enduml